        <!-- v18.2.0 (2026-09-21): FINAL ART-DIRECTION CONVERGENCE
             (target 9.5/10). Macro layout LOCKED; judged against the
             VM-only proof harness. Visible changes, not micro-numbers:
               - LEFT PAGE: two structural Nova gestures on the same
                 white silhouette - (A) an angular navy intrusion rising
                 behind the page's left edge, (B) a registration column
                 + quiet blueprint fragment linking masthead,
                 description and screenshot. ~90% of the page stays
                 calm white; the halftone fragment now spans the
                 description AND screenshot sections.
               - MARQUEE: zone 424x252@170 -> 432x272@160, top-anchored
                 headline presence; wide logos wider, tall logos use
                 more height. Missing-marquee fallback title now
                 top-aligned in a 96px box so the masthead collapses
                 instead of leaving a centred void.
               - TYPESETTING: description lineSpacing 1.5 -> 1.32
                 (tighter, editorial leading). Tracking refinements
                 were attempted but ES-DE 3.4.1 has no letterSpacing
                 (pinned validator rejects it); hierarchy carried by
                 size/weight/position instead. Players/developer
                 baseline unchanged.
               - SCREENSHOT: same size/position; integrated via the
                 page's registration motif (a registration cross pinned
                 to the frame's top-right corner).
               - SPINE: dotgrid removed; one porous window band lets
                 the Nova background continue across/behind the spine
                 (connector, not wall); the yellow line gains two
                 connector ticks marking the window.
               - HERO STAGE: museum blueprint treatment - three
                 concentric hairline circles, N/S/E/W crosshair ticks,
                 four corner registration marks, all alpha 8-20 over
                 the radial wash. Physical media stays dominant.
               - CAROUSEL: pos y 0.453125 -> 0.4666667 - previous peeks
                 ~78px (slightly more visible, still cropped); next
                 sits 50px clear of the metadata rail, cropped-entry
                 treatment kept. itemTransitions=animate retained.
               - TITLE PEDESTAL: 0.0260 -> 0.0275 (Zelda fits one line,
                 32px margins/side); tighter hero->title read.
             ES-DE 3.4.1 limits still stand. Fallbacks, hero/marquee/
             screenshot bindings: untouched. -->



